# Tier 2 (community) plugins — minimal contract, experimental.
#
# Examples that may land here:
#   lenovo-driver-update/  — Lenovo Vantage CLI wrapper
#   hp-driver-update/      — HP Image Assistant wrapper
#   asus-driver-update/    — ASUS Armoury Crate (manual download — fallback)
#   intel-driver-update/   — Intel Driver & Support Assistant
#
# Same plugin manifest schema as Tier 1, but `tier = "contrib"`.
